*.png
*.pdf

# output/ is ignored by the repo-root .gitignore (*/output/), which blocks
# git from descending into it at all. Un-ignore just the directory itself so
# the small text records (run_info.txt, rel2_history.csv) can be tracked --
# the heavy binary artifacts in there (*.pth, *.npy, *.png) are still
# excluded by the patterns above/at the repo root regardless.
!output/